# References

Reference materials, data dictionaries, manuals, and other explanatory documentation.

## Contents

- Data dictionaries and schema definitions
- Project briefs and requirements documents
- Research papers and literature
- Domain-specific documentation
- API documentation for external services

## Organization

Create subdirectories as needed:

```text
references/
├── data-dictionaries/
├── project-docs/
├── literature/
└── api-specs/
```
